  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 source of fresh blood</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p>You forge a weapon out of your own blood, that can freely shift shape between that of any weapon you know how to use.</p><p>Once per turn, you can change the form of your weapon as a <strong>Free Action</strong>. You can use an <strong>Action</strong> to change it again on the same turn.</p><p>If you choose a ranged weapon, it automatically produces its own ammunition, though it does not ignore the <strong>Reload</strong> trait.</p><p>When you deal <strong>Damage</strong> with this weapon, you can spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> or <strong>1 source of fresh blood</strong> to increase the <strong>Damage</strong> by an amount equal to your <strong>Soul</strong>.</p>",
